<p id="S7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This work was supported by NSFC 62350610269, Shanghai Frontiers Science Center of Human-centered Artificial
Intelligence, and MoE Key Lab of Intelligent Perception and Human-Machine Collaboration (ShanghaiTech University). This work was also supported by HPC platform of ShanghaiTech University.</p>
</div>
</section>
