<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib62.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Yi-Fan Zhang, Tao Yu, Haochen Tian, Chaoyou Fu, Peiyan Li, Jianshu Zeng, Wulin Xie, Yang Shi, Huanyu Zhang, Junkang Wu, Xue Wang, Yibo Hu, Bin Wen, Fan Yang, Zhang Zhang, Tingting Gao, Di Zhang, Liang Wang, Rong Jin, and Tien-Ping Tan.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib62.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Mm-rlhf: The next step forward in multimodal llm alignment.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib62.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">ArXiv</span><span id="bib.bib62.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, abs/2502.10391, 2025.
</span>
</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib63" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem"><span id="bib.bib63.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[63]</span></span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib63.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Yi-Fan Zhang, Huanyu Zhang, Haochen Tian, Chaoyou Fu, Shuangqing Zhang, Jun Wu, Feng Li, Kun Wang, Qingsong Wen, Zhang Zhang, Liang Wang, Rong Jin, and Tien-Ping Tan.
